    "updated_at": "2018-05-22T11:52:49Z",
    "body": "I would not be sad if we blocked redirect responses based on their MIME types. That said, I think we'd need to gather some data to determine how web-compatible it would be to tighten things here. I can imagine that servers accidentally rely on this kind of thing being ignored in the presence of `Location` headers.",
